  "description": "Lean 4 formalization of the native real-camera/Genuine zero identity, faithful empirical C2--C7 camera geometry, exact cutoff-tail jets, and the finite-to-limit transverse-energy architecture. Version 0.17.0 adds an analytic near-axis certificate for every critical Genuine zero of arbitrary positive finite multiplicity: each zero is isolated and admits a positive punctured horizontal nonvanishing radius. The certificate combines with nonvanishing on the complementary strip region to yield final confinement. The complement certificate and unconditional global strip-wide theorem remain open and are not promoted.",
